  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large skillet or wok over medium high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped bell pepper and cook until it is tender.",
    "Add the roasted peanuts and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the soy sauce and honey.",
    "Pour the soy sauce mixture over the peanut mixture and stir to combine.",
    "Add the grated ginger and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes and serve hot."
